{"mode":"words","text":"Augšā redzi tekstu tieši tā, kā to parāda lietotne. Katrs vārds ir neliela kartīte: augšā vārds mērķvalodā, zem tā — tā nozīme tavā dzimtajā valodā — vārds pēc vārda, mērķvalodas secībā. Zem tā atrodas viss teikums, kas vēlreiz ir tulkots plūstošā valodā. Valodām ar citu rakstību tiek pievienota rinda ar transkripciju, lai tu varētu visu izlasīt. Pieskarieties vārdam: balss turpinās atskaņot tieši no šīs vietas.","words":[{"s":0,"e":320},{"s":380,"e":640},{"s":700,"e":1040},{"s":1100,"e":1440},{"s":1520,"e":1840},{"s":1880,"e":2000},{"s":2080,"e":2240},{"s":2280,"e":2640},{"s":2667,"e":3360},{"s":3520,"e":4160},{"s":4200,"e":4480},{"s":4507,"e":4560},{"s":4600,"e":4960},{"s":5040,"e":6240},{"s":6300,"e":6640},{"s":6680,"e":6960},{"s":7000,"e":8240},{"s":8300,"e":8480},{"s":8560,"e":8800},{"s":8960,"e":9120},{"s":9160,"e":9280},{"s":9360,"e":9760},{"s":9820,"e":10080},{"s":10107,"e":10560},{"s":10600,"e":11120},{"s":11400,"e":11680},{"s":11760,"e":12000},{"s":12080,"e":12320},{"s":12360,"e":13000},{"s":13140,"e":13840},{"s":13920,"e":14560},{"s":14860,"e":15760},{"s":15840,"e":16080},{"s":16160,"e":16640},{"s":16680,"e":17040},{"s":17093,"e":18000},{"s":18040,"e":18160},{"s":18240,"e":18720},{"s":18747,"e":18800},{"s":18880,"e":19280},{"s":19333,"e":19920},{"s":19980,"e":20640},{"s":20860,"e":21840},{"s":21867,"e":21920},{"s":22000,"e":22320},{"s":22360,"e":22960},{"s":23080,"e":23560},{"s":23590,"e":24160},{"s":24200,"e":24560},{"s":24613,"e":24720},{"s":24787,"e":26000},{"s":26040,"e":26160},{"s":26187,"e":26240},{"s":26280,"e":26640},{"s":26700,"e":26960},{"s":27013,"e":27760},{"s":28280,"e":29440},{"s":29480,"e":30480},{"s":30620,"e":31120},{"s":31160,"e":31680},{"s":31707,"e":32080},{"s":32180,"e":32640},{"s":32747,"e":32960},{"s":33040,"e":33360},{"s":33440,"e":34080}]}